1. Component Communication?
  ->Lightning Web Components communicate with each other to share data and coordinate actions within an application.
1. Parent-to-Child Communication:
  ->A parent component passes data to a child component using public properties.
Example:
* Dashboard Component → Student Information Component
* Dashboard Component → Attendance Component
2. Child-to-Parent Communication:
  ->A child component sends information back to the parent using custom events.
Example:
* Attendance Component → Dashboard Component
* Notification Component → Dashboard Component
 Benefits of Component Communication:
* Better organization
* Reusable components
* Easier maintenance
* Improved scalability
* Clear data flow
